*  ------------------------------------------------------------  *
*  release October/11/2012                                       *
*  This level 3 model requires a model of the thermal path       *
*  to calculate the device temperature.                          *
*  Values of the internal thermal parameters are                 *
*  already included. The thermal parameters of an external heat- *
*  sink may be included as a physical correct thermal RC network *
*  connected to the node TCASE  and referenced to thermal ground *
*                                                                *
*  the global parameter tnom has no influence                    *
*                                                                *
*                                                                *
*  ***************************************************************

.SUBCKT IDH02G65C5_L3 ANODE KATODE TCASE TJ
LA ANODE AL 8n
RLA ANODE AL 100.000
VIA AL ANO 0
LK KAT KATODE 3n
RLK KAT KATODE 100.000
XSD ANO KAT TJ Pow SCS_G5_650V_v1a
+ PARAMS:
+ fpar01 1.705E-01
+ fpar02 1.451E-01
+ fpar03 3.156E-01
+ fpar04 4.016E-01
GPOW 0 TJ VALUE = {IF(time > 0,LIMIT(ABS(V(Pow,0)),0,1e10),0)}
RGPOW TJ 0 1meg
RTHD0 TJ td1 7.178E-01
RTHD1 td1 td2 1.167
RTHD2 td2 TCASE 6.663E-01
CTHD0 TJ 0 2.947E-05
CTHD1 td1 0 2.025E-04
CTHD2 td2 0 4.036E-03
.ENDS
